gimageview (0.2.27+gtk4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * GImageView 0.2.27 ported from GTK+ 2 to GTK 4, built with Meson.
  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Removed: Susie plugin support, lib/dllloader, the bundled libexif and
    MD5 code (the system libexif and GLib are used).
  * New GStreamer movie plugin (playback in the image view, movie
    thumbnails); archives are read with libarchive.
  * New loaders for Sun raster, WBMP, PNM and XPM; formats of the
    installed gdk-pixbuf loaders (WebP, AVIF, HEIF, JPEG XL, ...).
  * Printing, Set as Wallpaper, remembered rotation of each image,
    checkerboard behind transparency, comments in the thumbnail view.
  * Preferences: mouse side buttons (8, 9), color scheme (desktop theme,
    light, dark), icons of the desktop icon theme, splash window.
  * File open dialog: "Thumbnails of the selected files" also opens
    selected folders.
  * Manuals in Japanese and English with screenshots; the Help menu
    shows English for languages without documents.  README in Markdown
    (README.md).
  * See NEWS for all changes.

 -- shitamo <sitamo@gmail.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0900
